<title>USA: Investor cuts CRW Financial stake.</title>
<headline>Investor cuts CRW Financial stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eustace Mita, an investor from Wynnewood, Pa., said Wednesday he reduced his stake in CRW Financial Inc to 2.0 percent or 24,100 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Mita said he sold 59,900 shares of CRW between August 1 and 7 for a total of $2.44 million.</p>
<p>Mita said he continues to hold the stake in CRW for investment purposes.</p>
